Z||000001||Oreif||07-18-2000||03:33 AM||||Go to V-8 Archies website  <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com" TARGET=_blank>www.v8archie.com</A>  <BR>He has a white Fiero with the DGP/IRM IMSA body on it. What type of pics are you looking for? I do have the "Pontiac Performance Plus" that has mant detailed pics of the body and how to build the race car.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||007DOUG||07-18-2000||10:28 AM||||Mainly the side view of the FX's. I'm parting out this 84 coupe and the FX's, while added on, are not factory.<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=980876&a=7201939" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=980876&a=7201939</A>  <P> I know they aren't the IRM rocker panels (I have those on my T-top), so my next guess is DGP. They are fiberglass.<P>Or maybe J.C. Whitney. They used to sell fiero FX's. <P>shrug||||reg||1
Z||000003||Oreif||07-18-2000||11:33 AM||||Oh, Those are the old "Kamei" kit. It is called the "X1 Aero Kit". The kit had a front air dam and "wind splints" that mounted on the top of the fenders as added options. It was sold by IRM many years ago.  The only reason I remembered what it was is because there was a dealer here who sold a few Fieros with this kit on it and called it an "SS Fiero".<BR>Basically they stuck on the parts and added $2000 to the price of the car. Sort of like the "pinstripe" rip-off they use to pull where they put on $2.00 worth of pinstripe and charged $500.00 for custom stripes.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Monkeyman||07-18-2000||12:42 PM||||Doug--It actually is a copy of a copy of a copy.  I've seen an "original" IRM catalog and it doesn't look much different.  Someone took some pics, made copies, scanned them, then printed the catalog.  The guy who put them on the web just scanned the catalog.<P>Oreif--It's more like $1500.  My wife has the "Extreme" package on her '98 Cav which consists of a wide stripe down each side and a vinyl sticker on each side that says "Extreme".  $1495 but she just had to have it.||||reg||1
